        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kwezi kwa kashatu Abaisraeli baherize kuruga omu nsi ya Misri, aha kiro eki okwezi okwo kwabonekyeireho, bakahika omu ihamba rya Sinai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku baarugire Refidimu, baahika omu ihamba rya Sinai, baateera amahema omuri eryo ihamba; kandi Abaisraeli baaguma omu rusiisira omu maisho g'orushozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yainamuka ahari Ruhanga, MUKAMA yaamweta naayema aha rushozi, yaagira ati: Oku nikwo oraagambire enju ya Yakobo, noogambira Abaisraeli, oti: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 32:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.63.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 63:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mukareeba ebi naakozire Abanyamisri, kandi naimwe oku naabatwariire aha mapapa nk'empungu, nkabareeta ahariinye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.32.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Bir 32:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.135.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 135:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " N'ahabwekyo ku murihurira eiraka ryangye, mwarinda endagaano yangye, muryaba abantu bangye ahabwangye abatoorainwe omu mahanga goona; ahakuba ensi yoona n'eyangye; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1PE.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Pet 2:9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi muryambeera obukama bw'abanyamurwa n'eihanga eririkwera. Ebyo nibyo bigambo ebi oraagambire Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaija, yaayeta abakuru b'abantu, yaata omu maisho gaabo ebigambo ebyo byona ebi MUKAMA yaamuragiire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JOS.24.16+JOS.24.17+JOS.24.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yos 24:16-18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Abantu boona baagarukiramu hamwe, nibagira bati: Byona ebi MUKAMA yaagamba, nitwija kubikora. Musa yaagambira MUKAMA ebigambo ebyo ebi abantu baagamba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.97.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 97:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Reeba, niinyija ahariiwe omu kicu kikwaitse, ngu abantu bahurire ningamba naiwe, babone kukwikiriza ebiro byona. Bwanyima Musa yaagambira MUKAMA ebigambo by'abantu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.10.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 10:22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagambira Musa ati: Irooko oze omu bantu, obeeze eri izooba na nyencakare, boozye ebijwaro byabo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aha kiro kya kashatu bashangwe beeteekateekire; ahakuba ahari ekyo kiro kya kashatu MUKAMA naija kushuuma aha rushozi Sinai omu maisho g'abantu boona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.12.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 12:20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oteereho abantu obugarukiro okwehinguririza orushozi, obagire oti: Mwerinde, mutainamuka aha rushozi, n'obu kwakuba okukora aha bugarukiro bwarwo; omuntu weena oraakore aha rushozi, buzimazima naija kwitwa; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kandi hatagira omuntu weena owaamukoraho, kureka bamwitse amabaare, nari bamurashe; n'obu eraabe enyamaishwa nari omuntu, atagumaho. Enzamba ku eraagambe akasirikiriro, bainamukye, bahikye aha rushozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bwanyima Musa yaashuuma orushozi, yaaza omu bantu, yaabeeza, baayozya ebijwaro byabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CO.7.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kor 7:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " yaagambira abantu ati: Ekiro kya kashatu kishangye mweteekateekire; mutagira obu muhikire abakazi baanyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku bwaseesire aha kiro kya kashatu, enkuba zaahinda, emirabyo yaatyankana, ekicu kikwaitse kyaija ahari orwo rushozi, eiraka ry'enzamba ryagamba munonga, abantu boona, abaabaire bari omu rusiisira, baatetema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaashohoza abantu omu rusiisira kubugana Ruhanga, baayemerera ahansi y'orushozi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.68.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zab 68:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "PSA.68.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Orwo rushozi Sinai rwona rwacumba omwika, ahakuba MUKAMA akarushuumaho naizira omu muriro; omwika gwagwo gwacumbuuka nk'ogw'ekikoomi, orushozi rwona rwatengyeta munonga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eiraka ry'enzamba ku ryayeyongyeire kugamba munonga, Musa yaagamba, MUKAMA yaamugarukamu n'eiraka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA yaashuuma aha rushozi Sinai, aha mutwe gwarwo, yaayeta Musa kwinamuka aha mutwe gw'orwo rushozi; Musa yainamuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.6.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 6:19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: Irooko oshuume, oyehanangirize abantu, batakaayoga aha bugarukiro kuhika ahu MUKAMA ari kumushamaarira, baingi omuribo bakacwekyerera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2SA.6.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Sam 6:7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi n'abanyamurwa abairira haihi MUKAMA beeyeze, MUKAMA atakaabagwaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.19.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.19.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 19:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
